<title>LITHUANIA: Lithuanian Hermis Bank says to boost share capital.</title>
<headline>Lithuanian Hermis Bank says to boost share capital.</headline>
<dateline>VILNIUS 1997-02-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hermis Bank, one of Lithuania's leading commercial banks, said on Wednesday that its shareholders had decided to boost the bank's share capital by 23 million litas, to 90 million litas from 67 million litas.</p>
</text>
